# Fragile Scanner Areas

**Risk / formula SoT:** [CONCERNS.md](../../.specs/codebase/CONCERNS.md). Design: [ARCHITECTURE.md](../../.specs/codebase/ARCHITECTURE.md). Contracts: `schemas/` + ARCHITECTURE / TESTING § contract.

Any change under these globs **requires** a co-located Vitest update (or contract test for schemas) before Complete. Pipeline stage-order changes in `src/scan.ts` need integration coverage.

## Git Change Miner (`src/git/`)

Streaming `git log --numstat` parse for file churn.

**Forbidden:** buffering the full log; changing rename/merge/delete parse without `tests/fixtures/git-log/` coverage.

## Size analyzer / NCLOC (`src/complexity/`)

NCLOC state machine (RT-005 in CONCERNS).

**Forbidden:** changing count rules without `ncloc.test.ts` / `tests/fixtures/complexity/`. Unreadable file → `READ_FAILED` + skip (do not abort).

## Scoring (`src/scoring/`)

`hotspotScore` formula SoT: CONCERNS.md.

**Forbidden:** formula/normalization changes without fixed-input ordering tests (include zero commits / single file).

## Scan-result / schemas

Contract and reject rules: CONCERNS + `schemas/` + ARCHITECTURE. Do not auto-migrate legacy JSON; update `tests/contract/json-schema.test.ts` after schema edits. Do not reintroduce compare/coupling contracts without a new feature spec.
